# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRIVATE — NEVER PUBLISH
# _shots/ holds a real person's photograph and a 3D reconstruction of their
# face. Keep this rule first and do not remove it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
_shots/
_testimgs/

# The app's Save Frame / Export .obj buttons write files with exactly these
# names into the browser's download folder. If that folder is ever this repo,
# a real face capture would land next to the source. Keep them out.
face.jpg
face.obj
face.mtl
face-perspective-*.png
face-perspective-*.jpg
*.obj
*.mtl

